content.text:
The fault is a single pod failure in ts-station-service. Its old pod stopped at the start of the incident and was replaced about a minute later, and ts-basic-service's 500s stop once the replacement serves traffic. I'm naming it `pod_failure`, because the telemetry shows recovery within the window.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "ts-station-service",
      "fault_kind": "pod_failure",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT attr_k8s_pod_name, min(CAST(time AS VARCHAR)) first_seen, max(CAST(time AS VARCHAR)) last_seen, count(*) n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-station-service' GROUP BY 1",
          "claim": "Station pod j66bn emitted spans only until 15:08:38 (30 spans); replacement pod p9g9v took over from 15:09:36."
        },
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT substr(CAST(time AS VARCHAR),1,16) AS mins, sum(CASE WHEN service_name='ts-basic-service' AND attr_status_code='Error' AND attr_span_kind='Server' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS basic_5xx, sum(CASE WHEN service_name='ts-station-service' AND attr_span_kind='Server' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS station_server_spans FROM abnormal_traces GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1",
          "claim": "ts-basic-service 500s occur only in 15:08-15:09 while station served few spans, and stop once the replacement pod serves."
        },
        {
          "kind": "log",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, level, attr_log_template, count(*) c FROM abnormal_logs WHERE level='SEVERE' AND service_name='ts-basic-service' GROUP BY 1,2,3",
          "claim": "ts-basic-service logs SEVERE 'Connection refused' ResourceAccessException on outgoing I/O calls (179 times)."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {
      "from": "ts-station-service",
      "to": "ts-basic-service",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_span_kind, attr_status_code, attr_http_response_status_code, count(*) n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-basic-service' AND attr_status_code='Error' AND attr_span_kind IN ('Client','Server') GROUP BY ALL",
          "claim": "ts-basic-service client POST calls to station fail (~1s, no child span) and it returns HTTP 500 on /basic/travels."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "ts-basic-service",
      "to": "ts-travel-service",
